{"id":"n60641-1-7","stage":2,"title":"금연 · 禁烟","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n60641-1-7-1","ko":"아저씨, 이곳은 금연 구역이에요.","zh":"大叔，这里是禁烟区哦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아저씨,","meaning":"大叔，叔叔","explanation":"아저씨：大叔，叔叔","readings":[{"term":"아저씨","audio":"/audio/14cf4d2fee0defcf1f6b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26237","senseId":"2","lemma":"아저씨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이곳은","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"이곳：这里，这儿；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"이곳","audio":"/audio/f7b06733762a4646c18b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71130","senseId":"1","lemma":"이곳","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"금연","meaning":"禁烟","explanation":"금연：禁烟","readings":[{"term":"금연","audio":"/audio/00ec645587cb9417a86a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60641","senseId":"1","lemma":"금연","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"구역이에요.","meaning":"区域","explanation":"구역：区域；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；에요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"구역","audio":"/audio/366e0bfa41c1dcd36a2d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24546","senseId":"1","lemma":"구역","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"14cf4d2fee0defcf","term":"아저씨","zh":"大叔，叔叔","audio":"/audio/14cf4d2fee0defcf1f6b.mp3","entryId":"26237","definition":"陌生人之间用于指称或称呼没有老的成年男子。","pronunciation":["아저씨"]},{"id":"f7b06733762a4646","term":"이곳","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/f7b06733762a4646c18b.mp3","entryId":"71130","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["이곧"]},{"id":"00ec645587cb9417","term":"금연","zh":"禁烟","audio":"/audio/00ec645587cb9417a86a.mp3","entryId":"60641","definition":"禁止吸烟。","pronunciation":["그ː면"]},{"id":"366e0bfa41c1dcd3","term":"구역","zh":"区域","audio":"/audio/366e0bfa41c1dcd36a2d.mp3","entryId":"24546","definition":"按照一定基准或特性划分的多个区中的一个。","pronunciation":["구역"]}],"audio":"/audio/5bd058378561e264b361.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n60641-1-7-2","ko":"죄송합니다. 당장 끌게요.","zh":"对不起，我马上就熄灭。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"